                                                "sense_id": "84cdc541-488c-3045-aa8c-4df683d7e9ae",
                                                "text": "The fuselage and tail unit were constructed of welded chrome-moly steel tubing, fabric covered, with two seats in one elongated open 'bathtub' cockpit."
                                            }
